## Application Pages

| Page | Route | Features |
|------|-------|---------|
| Login | `/login` | Username/password + Google OAuth |
| Dashboard | `/` | KPI cards, quick stats |
| Members | `/members` | Full CRUD with modal forms |
| Attendance | `/attendance` | Check-in recorder + history |
| Membership | `/membership` | Plan management + expiry tracking |
| Analytics | `/analytics` | Charts, renewal rates, at-risk list |
| Reports | `/reports` | Downloadable CSV reports |

---

## Key Analytics Metrics

- **Total Registered Members** — count from live database
- **Renewal Rate** — `(renewed / total) × 100`
- **Non-Renewal Rate** — `(cancelled / total) × 100`
- **Average Attendance** — mean check-ins per member per month
- **Member Engagement Levels** — High / Medium / Low / At-Risk scoring
- **Potentially At-Risk Members** — members with low attendance + near-expiry membership

