## Getting Started

```bash
# 1. Clone the repository
git clone https://github.com/Saravanan845/fitness_membership_analysis.git
cd fitness_membership_analysis

# 2. Start the backend
cd backend
npm install
npm run dev        # Runs on http://localhost:5000

# 3. Start the frontend (new terminal)
cd frontend
npm install
npm run dev        # Runs on http://localhost:5173
```

**Demo login:** `admin` / `adminpassword123`

